        <briefdescription>
<para>Lock used to serialize all jit registration events, since they modify global variables. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Only a single instance of <ref refid="classanonymous__namespace_02_g_d_b_registration_listener_8cpp_03_1_1_g_d_b_j_i_t_registration_listener" kindref="compound">GDBJITRegistrationListener</ref> is ever created, and so the lock can be a member variable of that instance. This ensures destructors are run in the correct order. </para>
